      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "5f110d2207ca1b294f53cc50a7fd00946554acb1a35eced812f20d785b11bf8e:000000_-2848650292446324660:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "それで……不測の事態が起こった、って、\nいったい、何があったんですか、リコさん。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
